  idleFrameRate: 12
  description: "An infernal creature at home among flames, wielding heat and lava to its advantage."
  transformationMethod: "As the Mage, drink Lava while burning."
  transformationPotionSprites:
  - {fileID: -2172864323747464720, guid: edab2cf6e83ce054aa717b7051e46c14, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -8366473302825249247, guid: 0c2a77bcd3e4413429911e488f313155, type: 3}
  transformationHint: "As the Mage, drink in this order."
  cureMethod: "Drink a Light potion to return to the Mage."
  immunePotionSprites:
  - {fileID: 1853813971063210717, guid: ac82f27c79c5dee40a3125721fae32e4, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1834088911562275152, guid: 3bcbfe3450d294a45a466ee92b5a7219, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 3833926529033503733, guid: 1a1694ee82ded3342bde68515610b0d6, type: 3}
  spells:
  - nome: Fire Zone
    costo: 2
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4e37fdc8cf5486a488c7ee7fa3bcffab, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e05fae91473184b478941338d90f1f26, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Toggles the Fire field. Activating it replaces any other elemental field and empowers Balrog. Each toggle costs mana."
    descrizionePotenziata: "Same toggle and cost. Casting while Fire is active switches the field off."
    descrizioneBreve: "Toggle the Fire field to empower Balrog."
  - nome: Balance
    costo: 0
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5e12bad24caf60d489a377595771f903, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e05fae91473184b478941338d90f1f26, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Takes 3 HP and restores 1 MP. The HP loss can be fatal."
    descrizionePotenziata: "With the Fire field active: takes 3 HP and restores 2 MP."
    descrizioneBreve: "Trade 3 HP for 1 MP; 2 MP in Fire."
  - nome: Calderone
    costo: 8
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6dfd8a67c41b1543bdc42e767163a6b, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e05fae91473184b478941338d90f1f26, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Summons a cauldron that destroys potions dropped into it. The fifth non-Light potion raises light intensity by 1, once per activation."
    descrizionePotenziata: "With the Fire field active: summons the powered cauldron. It retains the same five-potion light reward; no extra HP or MP is granted."
    descrizioneBreve: "Summon a potion-destroying cauldron."

